{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43478","headline":"清风戒寒 · 无名氏","name":"清风戒寒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧飒清风至，悠然发思端。\n入林翻别叶，绕树败红兰。\n晓拂轻霜度，宵分远籁攒。\n稍依帘隙静，徧觉坐隅寒。\n乍逐惊蓬振，偏催急漏残。\n遥知洞庭水，此夕起波澜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}